  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 10.0 foundation library implementing Domain-Driven Design (DDD) and SOLID principles for enterprise applications. Provides base entity classes with audit functionality, generic Repository pattern, Unit of Work pattern, Entity Framework Core 10.0 integration, security utilities with Argon2 1.3.1 hashing, FluentValidation 12.1.0 support, and internationalization resources. Organized following Clean Architecture with separate Domain, Application, and Infrastructure layers. Ideal for building scalable, maintainable applications following clean architecture and SOLID principles.",
